<title>HUNGARY: SOPRONI H1 GROUP PRE-TAX PROFIT 704.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOPRONI H1 GROUP PRE-TAX PROFIT 704.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June</p>
<p>30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit    735.0     vs    392.8</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	704.9     vs    350.9</p>
<p>    Group net sales	   8,468.4     vs  6,881.8</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	  15.6     vs     95.8</p>
<p>    Material expenditures  5,947.5     vs   5,304.6</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures   618.5     vs     413.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 351.5     vs     290.5</p>
<p>    Other costs		  793.5     vs     422.0</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	 210.5     vs     222.5</p>
<p>    Net financial income	24.4 loss vs     76.8 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	 29.3     vs	 7.1</p>
<p>	Financial expend.	 53.7     vs	83.8</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income   5.7 loss vs     34.8 profit</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue   25.7     vs	60.9</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.   31.3     vs	26.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Soproni Sorgyar is a brewery. The figures are</p>
<p>consolidated, unaudited and were calculated in accordance with</p>
<p>Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
